Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:42.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《007系列之雷霆杀机》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.04,0:00:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,影片中的“佐伦”及所有人物角色均属虚构
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非影射任何公司或人物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为你永远回不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you'd never get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿极度挤拥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there was a heck of a crowd on the piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.90,0:05:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 任务完成了？- 最好的鱼子酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mission accomplished? - Best beluga…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.21,0:05:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏特加 要轻摇匀的还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}vodka, rather shaken, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.31,0:05:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一块微型晶片 - 真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- one microchip. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.78,0:05:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我通知M\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make a signal to M.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.19,0:05:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,可否做我的乖女孩 让它自动行驶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a good girl, would you, and put her on automatic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以喝杯酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we could do with a couple of glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒杯在头顶的架子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in the overhead rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德中校！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Commander Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.61,0:06:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我詹姆斯吧 到阿拉斯加要五天的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me James. It's five days to Alaska.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.12,0:09:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始 前进！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk. March!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.27,0:09:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 你终于回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank goodness you're here, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.37,0:09:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓 很漂亮呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very nice, Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.68,0:10:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,上班时穿这样 不是太隆重吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think it's a little over the top for the office?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.75,0:10:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我整个上午都在找你 你在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried to reach you all morning. What have you been up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.45,0:10:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 休息和消遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, rest and recreation, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,从西伯利亚回来的旅程使我累透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trip back from Siberia took a lot out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对工作的全力投入是最值得表扬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dedication when you're on the job is most commendable, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.06,0:10:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓小姐 别说客套话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Omit the customary pleasantries, Miss Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有时问\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're pressed for time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.46,0:10:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍后再跟你说 钱班霓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fill you in later, Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.78,0:10:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 两位 - 邦德 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Minister. Good morning, sir. - Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.18,0:10:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q 是新宠物吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new pet, Q?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.58,0:10:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你看过我部门发出的备忘录\N{\fnArial\fs30}If, 007, you'd ever bother to read any memos from my department…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你定会知道这是一个精密监测仪器的样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would realize this is a prototype of a sophisticated surveillance machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.43,0:10:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以开始简报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that we're all here, you can get on with the briefing, Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.73,0:10:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.63,0:10:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,硅集成电路…\N{\fnArial\fs30}a silicon integrated circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是所有现代电脑的重要部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}The essential part of all modern computers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要教学 Q 我们都知道微型晶片的实用性\N{\fnArial\fs30}No lecture, Q. We're all aware of the usefulness of the microchip.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.61,0:11:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到最近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now, until recently…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,微型晶片被发现容易受到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}all microchips were susceptible to damage…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,核爆引致的磁脉冲所破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the intense magnetic pulse of a nuclear explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.79,0:11:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 磁脉冲？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Magnetic pulse? - Yes, Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,若在英国上空的外太空爆炸 所有镶有微型晶片的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}One burst in outer space over the U.K., and everything with a microchip…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.66,0:11:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,从烤面包机到最精密的电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the modern toaster to the most sophisticated computers…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们的防卫系统等都会变得没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our defense systems would be rendered absolutely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会被苏俄弄至瘫痪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd be paralyzed at the Russian's mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.07,0:11:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们其中一个私人承办商就发明了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why one of our private defense contractors came up with this…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一块完全不受磁脉冲破坏的晶片\N{\fnArial\fs30}a chip totally impervious to magnetic pulse damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.58,0:11:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我把它放在微型比较仪上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if I place it on the microcomparator…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.85,0:11:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,再跟邦德在西伯利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and compare it with the chip Commander Bond recovered…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.65,0:11:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,003的身上所寻回的晶片比较…\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the body of 003 in Siberia…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我把两个影像结合时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I bring the two images together…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.43,0:11:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们完全相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're identical.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.83,0:11:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,国安会一定有渠道取得了那研究公司的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}The KGB must have a pipeline into that research company.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.83,0:12:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would appear so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.73,0:12:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个月前 该公司被一家英法联合公司收购\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six months ago, that company was acquired by an Anglo-French combine…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.20,0:12:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伦工业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zorin Industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.87,0:12:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 已对工厂进行了安全检查？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I presume, sir, there has been a security check of the plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.44,0:12:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,已大规模地检查 但找不到线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a very extensive one, but we have no leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.55,0:12:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伦本人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Zorin himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.85,0:12:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦斯佐伦？不可能 他是法国首席工业家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max Zorin? Lmpossible. He's a leading French industrialist…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.65,0:12:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对反共产主义 认识不少有影响力的政府官员\N{\fnArial\fs30}a staunch anticommunist with influential friends in the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 不过 部长…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but with due respect, Minister…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.23,0:12:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,消息的确是在佐伦收购那公司之后给泄露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the leak did occur after Zorin bought the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.20,0:12:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我已经展开调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely why I've already initiated an investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我们得谨慎一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, but for heaven's sake, let's be discreet about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.70,0:12:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 部长\N{\fnArial\fs30}But of course, Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.21,0:12:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你35分钟梳洗装扮正式点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have exactly 35 minutes to get properly dressed, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.32,0:12:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快些 弗卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Fluke…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.72,0:12:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快移动你的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}move your a…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.66,0:12:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是第一？那匹灰色的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's number one… the gray with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是佐伦的马 珀加索斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Pegasus, Zorin's horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.63,0:13:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个拿着手杖的就是佐伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the cane… is that Max Zorin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.46,0:13:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 生于德勒斯登\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Born in Dresden…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.73,0:13:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,60年代从东德逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}fled from East Germany in the '60s…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.67,0:13:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,持法国护照 至少会讲五种语言 而且没口音\N{\fnArial\fs30}French passport, speaks at least five languages with no accent…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.91,0:13:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是当今城中的谈论焦点 而且位高权重\N{\fnArial\fs30}now the talk of the city and the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跑快些！- 又是老掉牙的暴发致富的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Fluke! - The old rags-to-riches story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,石油汽油贸易为他带来第一批财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made his first fortune in oil and gas trading…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在轮到电子和高科技工业\N{\fnArial\fs30}now a second in electronics and high-tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个在他身边、鼓着帽子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that with him, under the hat…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿红裙子的是他女朋友吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the red dress… girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.36,0:13:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对她所知不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not sure about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是美国人 从不离开他半步\N{\fnArial\fs30}American… she's never far from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.69,0:13:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字叫美黛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name's May Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她懂得为场合穿衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}And dressed for the occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗卢克 加把劲！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Fluke, get a wiggle on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.89,0:14:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一名是一号、第二名是二号 第三名是五号\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, number one; second, number two; and third, number five.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.69,0:14:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一名 一号珀加索斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}First number one, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二名 二号弗卢克 第三名 五号美洲狮女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second number two, Fluke;and third number five, Cooper Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.41,0:14:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当了多年练马师\N{\fnArial\fs30}In all my years as a trainer…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没见过在最后冲刺时跑得这样快的马\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen a horse run such a fast last furlough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.41,0:14:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们部门的戈弗雷帝毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Godfrey Tibbett, our department.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.62,0:14:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恭喜你 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Many congratulations. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.56,0:14:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伦很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky man, Zorin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.69,0:14:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不尽是幸运 - 贿赂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could be more than luck, admiral. - Fixed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.83,0:14:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的估计跟我的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your guess is as good as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.83,0:14:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国赛马会已雇用我一位侦探朋友…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The French Jockey Club have hired a detective friend of mine…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥伯格林去追查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aubergine, to look into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.80,0:14:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静下来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.54,0:15:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻松点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy. Steady, steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.65,0:15:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她一定吃了很多维他命 - 冷静些\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She must take a lot of vitamins. - Steady, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.82,0:15:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许珀加索斯也一样 - 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Perhaps Pegasus does too. - Easy, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.75,0:15:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该跟你的侦探朋友见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I should meet with this detective friend of yours, Sir Godfrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.32,0:15:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 也许会有些有趣的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Might have some interesting information for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.33,0:15:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你准备一下 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Set it up, Tibbett. - Right you are, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.80,0:15:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓 可以帮我拿彩金吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moneypenny, be a darling, would you, and collect that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.27,0:15:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去时我请你吃晚饭 珀加索斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll buy you dinner when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.82,0:15:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,1975年的博林根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bollinger, '75.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎你也是专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you are a connoisseur, Monsieur Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.06,0:15:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是一个极好的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another excellent choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你同意 因为付帐的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am pleased you approve, since you're paying the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:15:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.47,0:16:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指S局没有佐伦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were saying that the S?iret has no information about Zorin…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.64,0:16:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在逃离东德前的资料？\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he came over from East Germany?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.51,0:16:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经过线人亲自看过他的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through a personal connection, I saw his dossier myself…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.11,0:16:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过即使S局的那些档案有时也会有所缺漏吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but even S?iret?records are sometimes incomplete, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷人的多米尼克…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fabulous Dominique…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,和漂亮的凤蝶\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the enchanted papillons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.06,0:16:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们或许应把这些蝴蝶拨入收藏品中 不好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we should add this butterfly to our collection, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.43,0:17:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何佐伦的马…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, why do Zorin's horses…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.14,0:17:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,能击败其他优良血统的马匹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}beat others with far superior bloodlines?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是一个谜 - 他有使用药物吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is a mystery. - Could he be using drugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.58,0:17:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,测试结果显示没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing showed up on the tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.92,0:17:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,本月稍后时间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later this month…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伦会在他位于巴黎附近的马场举行年度展销会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zorin will hold his annual sales at a stud near Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.89,0:17:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,保全非常严密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security is formidable…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过谜团的答案就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the key to this mystery is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.46,0:17:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥伯格林很想找它出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Achilles Aubergine, intend to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.88,0:17:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的汤里有苍蝇\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a fly in his soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.15,0:19:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 追那降落伞 - 别说英语\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Follow that parachute! - Is in English.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.92,0:19:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My car!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.81,0:21:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.30,0:21:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说过这行动要谨慎地进行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I remind you that this operation was to be conducted discreetly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.44,0:21:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你造成六百万法郎的破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}All it took was six million francs in damage…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.74,0:21:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有违反部分拿破仑法典的罚款\N{\fnArial\fs30}and penalties for violating most of the Napoleonic Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.68,0:21:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那情形下 我觉得去识别出暗杀者是很重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under the circumstances, sir, I felt it important to identify the assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.68,0:21:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在奥伯格林不幸过杀时知道了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you learn from Aubergine before his untimely demise?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.25,0:21:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伦将在附近的一个马场售卖他的纯种马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, only that Zorin is having a thoroughbred sale at his stud nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.03,0:21:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I should be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.06,0:21:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈弗雷爵士 你可以帮我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help me with that, Sir Godfrey?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.70,0:22:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,安排获邀请应该没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may be possible to arrange an invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.87,0:22:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然通知时间短促\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bit short notice…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.80,0:22:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但应该是没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I might just be able to squeeze you in, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.67,0:22:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.15,0:22:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈弗雷爵士 请戴上帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Godfrey, your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.23,0:22:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣约翰史密尔先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. St. John Smythe?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.13,0:22:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是圣约翰史迈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}St. John Smythe, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.00,0:22:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,史迈尔先生 我是安全部主管斯卡彭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Smythe, my name is Scarpine, head of security.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.17,0:22:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 已为你在城堡里准备了房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you do? - We have a room for you at the chateau.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.74,0:22:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.97,0:22:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是了 主马厩已开始进行预展\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, the preview is already in progress at the main stables.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.34,0:22:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是那儿吗？- 不 那些是仆人的住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that it? - No, those are the servants' quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.35,0:22:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,马厩在那一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stable's over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.02,0:22:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我带你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me escort you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.43,0:23:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是马匹的目录 - 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Catalogue of the sales. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那匹幼驹伊萨古斯 它在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, the lthacus colt… is it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.54,0:23:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你指珀加索斯的嫡亲弟弟？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean the full brother of Pegasus? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.41,0:23:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是这次展销中心最出众的马\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the outstanding horse of the sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.41,0:23:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会最后迟出来 我们预期它以超过三百万卖出\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be shown last. We expect him to fetch over $3 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.39,0:23:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来颇合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds quite reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.96,0:23:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你有什么需要就找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're in need of any further assistance, please call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.99,0:23:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.24,0:23:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,珀加索斯 镇静点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady! Steady, Pegasus, steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.78,0:23:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,牢牢绑着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep him on a tight rein!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.04,0:24:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三十号 我们非常荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot number 30. We are now very proud…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.01,0:24:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你介绍珀加索斯的嫡亲弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}to present the full brother to Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.61,0:24:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这匹一岁大的幼驹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This yearling foal is born…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.32,0:25:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伦先生有事被耽搁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Zorin has been unavoidably detained.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.92,0:25:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很希望见你 他想在稍后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's anxious to meet you, hopes to do so at the reception…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.35,0:25:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,城堡花园的欢迎会中跟你见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the chateau gardens later.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.86,0:25:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我期待着 帝毕 请你别到处逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look forward to it. There you are, Tibbett. I wish you wouldn't wander off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.33,0:25:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那才是个友好仆人 - 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's a good chap. - I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.49,0:25:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的司机可以在仆人的住处过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your driver may stay the night in the servants' quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.00,0:25:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信对他来说已足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, I'm sure that'll be more than adequate for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.10,0:25:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗 帝毕？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say, Tibbett?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.03,0:25:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎你 我是珍妮弗斯 - 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome, sir. I'm Jenny Flex. - Of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.00,0:25:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫服务生来 - 不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll call a porter. - Oh, that won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.10,0:25:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的下人会搬的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My man'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.64,0:26:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我带你到房间去 - 麻烦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me show you to your room. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.51,0:26:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好就上来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're ready, Tibbett.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.91,0:26:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你花许多时间骑马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my dear, I take it you spend quite a lot of time in the saddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.25,0:26:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 我喜欢早上骑马 - 我也是早起床的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I love an early-morning ride. - I'm an early riser myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.19,0:26:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上来 帝毕 别再喘气体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along, Tibbett. Stop wheezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.11,0:26:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别站着喘气 帝毕 把衣物拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't stand there panting, Tibbett. Start the unpacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.55,0:26:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我帮你 - 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, let me help you. - Yes, sir. Oh, thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.36,0:26:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎会六点开始 - 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The reception is at 6:00. - Thank you, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.60,0:27:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到弗斯小姐说吧 六点有欢迎会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Tibbett, you heard what Miss Flex said: There's a reception at 6:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.70,0:27:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 我要穿白色外衣 黑领带\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - So, white jacket and black tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.44,0:27:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.57,0:27:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以的话 要一件干净衬衫 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And, if possible, a clean shirt. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.54,0:27:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 看看我的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my Lord, Tibbett. Look at the state of my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.31,0:27:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎样放置我的行李的？- 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How on earth do you pack my bags? - Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.12,0:27:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,福勒先生向他的练马师说 他会用一百万号竞投伊萨古斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fowler has told his trainer he'll go to a million for the lthacus colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.06,0:27:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极 听到史迈尔什么说吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Anything from St. John Smythe?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.79,0:27:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没说关于买马的事 幸好我不是他的司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing about the sales, sir, but I'd hate to be his valet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.10,0:27:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你下次不要这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're certainly going to have to buck up your ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.43,0:27:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.80,0:27:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样卑躬屈膝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so damned obsequious.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.64,0:27:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 这些鞋子怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my Lord. What the devil's wrong with these shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.61,0:27:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,像给满是油的抹布擦过似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They look as if they were wiped over with an oily rag.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.51,0:27:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很对不起 - 一点都没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Terribly sorry, sir. - You blasted well should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.25,0:27:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否不想再做我的仆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how long you expect to remain in my employ…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.66,0:28:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, my good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.46,0:28:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我们单独时都要继续做戏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have to keep this up when we're alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.33,0:28:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美的乔装是必不可少的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, a successful cover becomes almost second nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.50,0:28:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,珀加索斯不见了是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's all this business about Pegasus disappearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.40,0:28:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这分钟它还在马厩里 下分钟却突然消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One minute he's in his stall, the next… neither hide nor hair of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.14,0:28:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要去查一查 - 不要太担心这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should look into it. - Don't concern yourself with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.12,0:28:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我在珀加索斯马厩里见到的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the man I saw at the Pegasus stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.88,0:28:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 另一个有钱马主？- 谁知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Another wealthy owner? - Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.38,0:29:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过最好密切监视她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she'd certainly bear closer inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.52,0:29:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们有任务在身的 - 戈弗雷爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're on a mission. - Sir Godfrey…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.82,0:29:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已准备为进行任务而牺牲自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a mission, I am expected to sacrifice myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.21,0:29:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好的派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely party.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.33,0:30:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,史迈尔先生 喜欢这派对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoying our little party, Monsieur St. John Smythe?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.23,0:30:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 我叫史迈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, immensely. St. John Smythe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.70,0:30:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎你将有不错的收获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you'll have a good turnout for the sale tomorrow, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.50,0:30:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.76,0:30:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是塞顿小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I introduce Miss Sutton?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.73,0:30:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 法罗酋长 - 你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sheik Farouq. - How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.87,0:31:32.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（祈付塞顿五百万）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.50,0:31:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's a great pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.64,0:31:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎 - 佐伦先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome. - Mr. Zorin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.91,0:31:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,「主攻计划」已准备好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Main Strike all set?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.98,0:31:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 在22日之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no. After the 22nd.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.38,0:31:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 请随便\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Merci. - Enjoy yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.96,0:31:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在找什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were looking for something?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.66,0:31:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我想到酒吧去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I was looking for the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.56,0:32:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我带你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, I will show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.57,0:32:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是了 是 圣约翰史迈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, the name is St. John Smythe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.87,0:32:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯圣约翰史迈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}James St. John Smythe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.74,0:32:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔莫勒博士 多多指教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Carl Mortner, at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.91,0:32:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 博士 - 你好 午安 科尼先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hiya, Doc. - Good afternoon, Mr. Conley.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.32,0:32:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尼先生 史迈尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Conley, Mr. Smythe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.05,0:32:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍伯科尼 - 你是练马师吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bob Conley. - Are you a trainer?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.52,0:32:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连骑马也不会 我从事石油业的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horses? Hell, I can't even ride. I'm in the oil business.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.93,0:32:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克萨斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Texas?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.80,0:32:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧金山 我处理佐伦先生那边的石油事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frisco. I handle Mr. Zorin's oil interests there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.33,0:32:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you excuse us?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.60,0:32:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我带你看些有趣的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, honey. I'll show you something really interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.07,0:32:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是医学博士吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, are you a doctor of medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.64,0:32:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是佐伦先生的马匹繁殖顾问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Mr. Zorin's breeding consultant.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.55,0:32:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？那么你可以解答我的疑问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really? Then you can let me in to a little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.45,0:32:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如何能成功繁殖…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it you succeed with breeding bloodlines…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.75,0:32:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他专家认为是低劣品种的马匹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that other experts consider inferior?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.69,0:33:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择性繁殖的确重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selective breeding is important, ja…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.12,0:33:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但更重要的却是训练和欲望 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but more important is conditioning and a desire, ja?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.43,0:33:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指对人还是对马？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you talking about people or horses?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.70,0:33:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的原理同样应用到人类身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}My principles apply equally to human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.04,0:33:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,史迈尔先生 让我自我介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. St. John Smythe, allow me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.14,0:33:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伦先生 幸会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Zorin, it's a great pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.91,0:33:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 有一个马夫请你到马厩去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, one of the grooms asked if you'd go to the stables.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.08,0:33:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. You will excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.51,0:33:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 佐伦先生 你的马厩很壮丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must congratulate you, Mr. Zorin. Your stables are magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.52,0:33:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是16世纪时由一位公爵建造的 他深信自己会化身为马匹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Built in the 16th century by a duke who believed he'd reincarnate as a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.96,0:33:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很久前已对纯种马有兴趣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been interested in thoroughbreds long?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.99,0:33:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 其实是我一位古怪的姨母死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. As a matter of fact, I had a rather dotty old aunt die…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.56,0:33:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,留给我一些马厩 所以我才想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave me some stables, so I thought it might be rather fun…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.90,0:33:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,繁殖和饲养马匹\N{\fnArial\fs30}to breed and raise horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.53,0:33:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你爱骑马\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it you ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.97,0:33:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我最开心的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happiest in the saddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.94,0:33:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然是爱好运动的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fellow sportsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.14,0:33:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,钓鱼呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about fishing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.38,0:33:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,假蝇钩鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fly casting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.18,0:33:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去招呼其他宾客\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm neglecting my other guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.02,0:34:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,请随便 你会发觉她们会是刺激的伴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy yourself. You'll find the young ladies stimulating company.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.99,0:34:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信她们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.20,0:34:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 为何不跟其他人一起？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. I thought you might like to join the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.07,0:34:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是了 我叫做圣约翰史迈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, the name is James St. John Smythe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.04,0:34:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm English.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.75,0:34:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真猜不到 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I never would have guessed. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.19,0:34:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是买家还是卖家？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, are you buying or selling?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.99,0:34:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卖家？- 马匹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Selling? - Horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.53,0:34:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对马匹没有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not interested in horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.43,0:34:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你不该到这里来 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you came to the wrong place, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.07,0:34:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,美黛\N{\fnArial\fs30}May Day…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.67,0:34:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他接近她\N{\fnArial\fs30}get her away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.01,0:35:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定曾在什么地方见过他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure I've seen him somewhere before.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.68,0:35:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,请警卫盯紧他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have security keep a good eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.02,0:35:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没说你来自什么地方 你是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, you didn't say what part of the States you come from, Miss…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.05,0:35:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.06,0:35:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你经常到处去旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you travel a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.93,0:35:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的直升机二十分钟后离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your helicopter leaves in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.63,0:35:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚不会留下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, does that mean you're not staying the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.23,0:35:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想跟你一起共度今宵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping we'd spend the evening together.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.17,0:35:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只剩我一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I shall be all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.77,0:35:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.67,0:35:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我送你上直升机 - 不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, let me walk you to the chopper. - That won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.61,0:35:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人会照顾你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone will take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.48,0:35:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会亲自确定的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you'll see to that personally, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.19,0:36:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在找这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you looking for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.13,0:36:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下去的好方法真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite a letdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.81,0:37:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史迈尔怎么样？- 像婴儿般酣睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- St. John Smythe? - Sleeping like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.87,0:38:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.90,0:38:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. There we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.30,0:38:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.98,0:38:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣 它动过手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's interesting. He's had surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.76,0:38:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,手术？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surgery…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.89,0:38:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以佐伦才会赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is how Zorin won the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.43,0:38:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫勒博士将这样的微型晶片植入珀加索斯体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}The good Herr Doktor Mortner implanted one of these microchips into Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.00,0:38:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 这些微型晶片…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, these microchips…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.47,0:38:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够控制注射到马匹身体里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}are programmed to control an injection…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.97,0:38:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,多余的类固醇\N{\fnArial\fs30}of additional natural horse steroids…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.71,0:38:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,使马匹在比赛中不会感到乏力\N{\fnArial\fs30}which will overcome fatigue during the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.84,0:38:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样运作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.08,0:38:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,液体由这小针筒注射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the injection itself, with that small needle, is triggered…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.38,0:38:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它由遥控发射器操控\N{\fnArial\fs30}by a remote control transmitter…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.18,0:39:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,外型细小 能藏在骑师的马鞭尖端…\N{\fnArial\fs30}small enough to fit into the tip of a jockey's whip…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.45,0:39:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者笞条的尖瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a cane.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.69,0:39:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,关灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.49,0:39:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伦把这么多的微型晶片囤积起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a world surplus of microchips, and Zorin is hoarding them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.45,0:40:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉没帮上什么忙 - 放心 已处理好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm afraid I wasn't much help. - Don't worry, it's all wrapped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.80,0:41:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,提高警觉 保持平街\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your guard up higher, and retain your balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.57,0:41:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.82,0:41:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在怎办？- 我们最好回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What now? - We better get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.49,0:41:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,录音带五分钟前已播放完 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tape ran out five minutes ago. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.08,0:42:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你别骚扰我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you not to disturb us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.18,0:42:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过此事非常重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.85,0:42:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,仓库曾被人进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been intruders in the warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.91,0:42:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫警卫全面戒备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put security on full alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.95,0:42:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看史迈尔先生在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see where Mr. St. John Smythe is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.19,0:43:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是艾菲尔铁塔的那个男子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the man at the Eiffel Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.89,0:43:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们必须找他出来 - 我去更衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We must find him. - I'll get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.60,0:43:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,美黛 你去了哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May Day, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.36,0:43:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.20,0:43:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,「亲自照顾我」\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take care of me personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.45,0:43:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是个不多言的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you're a woman of very few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.76,0:43:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么需要说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's there to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.71,0:44:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么不见了吗？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is everything here? - Ja, ja.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.02,0:44:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.52,0:44:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在不当的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is in the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.22,0:44:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早第一件事就是叫史迈尔到我书房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring St. John Smythe to my study first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.04,0:44:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 - 早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning. - Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.77,0:44:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand you wish to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.07,0:44:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 睡的好吗？- 有一点失眠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You slept well? - A little restless…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.14,0:44:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我最终也能入睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I got off eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.85,0:44:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的电脑上有一个幼驹索引\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the progeny index on the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.68,0:44:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当中有一个纯种马血统的汇编\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a compilation of thoroughbred bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.35,0:44:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许能帮你在下午拣选你要买的马匹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be helpful to you in selecting your purchase this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.02,0:44:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该需要一匹种马…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I see it, you need a stallion…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.69,0:44:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来繁殖\N{\fnArial\fs30}for breeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.86,0:44:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也颇合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}A stallion sounds right to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.37,0:45:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发觉电脑是不可缺少的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find a computer indispensable.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.57,0:45:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一匹种马\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a stallion…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.34,0:45:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那匹马的后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}descended from that horse there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.71,0:45:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,米斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Misty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.14,0:45:22.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（要求确认身分 自称英国人 圣约翰史迈尔）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.06,0:45:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑显示了我们有数匹马或许是你有兴趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the computer, we have several horse that might interest you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.86,0:45:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.65,0:45:33.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（英国情报员詹姆斯邦德 极度危险人物）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.84,0:45:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你注重体力还是速度？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you be interested primarily in stamina or speed?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.01,0:45:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,两方面都有就最理想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, a little of both would be ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.63,0:45:45.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（职业杀手）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.38,0:45:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我有一匹合适你的马\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I have just the horse for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.92,0:45:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去骑马了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for my morning ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.59,0:45:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你去试试策骑它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you try him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.42,0:45:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds a very good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.46,0:46:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我先去更衣 - 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I shall get into some riding clothes. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.76,0:46:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那半小时后见 斯卡彭会来接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half an hour then? Scarpine will collect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.50,0:46:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.01,0:46:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝毕 进城里 叫M追查这张支票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tibbett, get into town. Call M and ask him to put a trace on this check.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.98,0:46:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去 若我们被侍卫认出 我们就得尽快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be as quick as you can. If those guards identify us, we'll have to move fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.18,0:46:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,若他们问我去哪里 我怎回答？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What shall I say if they ask where I'm going?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.99,0:46:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说要去洗车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to get the car washed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.11,0:46:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要到城里去洗车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just going to town to get the car washed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.27,0:47:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以骑了 史迈尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mount, Mr. St. John Smythe.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.58,0:47:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然是骏马\N{\fnArial\fs30}A beautiful beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.68,0:47:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满生气 它叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little spirited. What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.08,0:47:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inferno.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.94,0:49:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你的朋友吗？- 是练习骑师\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Friends of yours? - Exercise boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.04,0:49:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起跳是比较实际的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jumping together is more realistic training.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.11,0:49:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦白说 我喜欢越野赛多于障碍赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, quite frankly, I prefer cross-country to steeplechase.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.68,0:49:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一个爱好运动的人 我向你作出这个提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}As one sportsman to another, I'll make you a proposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.39,0:49:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你能完成这赛道 我免费把伊萨古斯送给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have that lthacus colt gratis if you stay this course.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.46,0:49:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我堕马呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I'm thrown?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.76,0:49:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.13,0:49:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我并无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave me little choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.94,0:49:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极 斯卡彭会示意开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splendid. Scarpine will start us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.88,0:50:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇定！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.14,0:51:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.38,0:51:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈弗雷 我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Godfrey, let's…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.23,0:51:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输了 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.23,0:51:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀掉帝毕是错的做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing Tibbett was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.64,0:51:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算再犯一次这样的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm about to make the same mistake twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.84,0:51:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国当局知道我在此的 若我不报告 他们会报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}My department know I'm here. When I don't report, they'll retaliate.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.61,0:51:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你是他们最佳的情报员\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're the best they have…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.24,0:51:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会乐意掩饰你不能胜任的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll more likely try to cover up your embarrassing incompetence.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.11,0:51:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别指望它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't count on it, Zorin.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.62,0:51:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你使我发笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You amuse me, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.38,0:52:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's not mutual.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.59,0:52:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,到另一边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.09,0:52:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.53,0:54:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 佐伦同志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Comrade Zorin.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.34,0:54:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈高将军 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Gogol.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.77,0:54:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次会议很冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}This meeting is ill-advised.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.57,0:54:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是冒险但有需要 因为你不听从指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}A calculated risk, but necessary, since you refuse to answer your control.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.51,0:54:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有话直说 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to the point, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.15,0:54:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不理会程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}You disregard procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.15,0:54:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在未得到同意前 就消灭007\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not request approval before eliminating 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.75,0:54:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,报复行动或会妨害计划的进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reprisals might jeopardize ongoing operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.39,0:54:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妨害我的计划！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You jeopardize mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.66,0:54:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟让英国人渗入西伯利亚研究中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letting the British penetrate the Siberian research center.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.60,0:55:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那令人遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was regrettable.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.17,0:55:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的赛马活动引来不必要的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your racing activities attract unnecessary attention…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.30,0:55:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但更讨厌的是你未得批准而进行商业投机活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}but more disturbing are your unauthorized commercial ventures…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.84,0:55:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝不可以容忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we cannot tolerate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.58,0:55:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事已没关系 我已作新的联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The issue is irrelevant. I've made new associations.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.61,0:55:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再视自己为国安会情报员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I no longer consider myself a KGB agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.32,0:55:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是由我们训练的 资金是我们提供的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We trained you, financed you…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.12,0:55:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有我们你怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you be without us?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.69,0:55:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物实验？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A biological experiment?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.79,0:55:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,生理上的怪物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A physiological freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.73,0:55:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了！不要胡闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough of this! Control yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.18,0:55:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会回来的 同志\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will come back to us, Comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.31,0:55:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会逃离国安会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one ever leaves the KGB.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.32,0:55:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 数百年来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, for centuries…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.09,0:55:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼金术士尝试从贱金属中炼金\N{\fnArial\fs30}alchemists tried to make gold from base metals.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.42,0:56:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们由硅制造出微晶片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, we make microchips from silicon…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.33,0:56:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,硅是一般的沙但比黄金要好\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is common sand, but far better than gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.87,0:56:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,数年来 我们都是互惠的伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, for several years we've had a profitable partnership…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.54,0:56:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去制造而我就去找和传达…\N{\fnArial\fs30}you as manufacturers, while I acquired and passed on to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.21,0:56:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些能增加你的竞争力和使你们成功的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}industrial information that made you competitive…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.88,0:56:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,工业资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.65,0:56:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正处于一个独特的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are now in the unique position…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.45,0:56:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,去组成一个国际企业联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}to form an international cartel…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.89,0:56:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,去控制不只是微型晶片的生产\N{\fnArial\fs30}to control not only production…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.26,0:56:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还有分配权\N{\fnArial\fs30}but distribution of these microchips.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.73,0:56:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有一个障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one obstacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.14,0:56:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,硅谷…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silicon Valley…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.35,0:56:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在旧金山附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}near San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.55,0:56:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,超过250家工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over 250 plants…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.15,0:57:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,聘用数千个科学家和技师\N{\fnArial\fs30}employing thousands of scientists, technicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.79,0:57:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿是美国电子生产的心脏地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the heartland of electronic production in the United States…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.39,0:57:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,占了全世界…\N{\fnArial\fs30}which accounts for what… 80 percent?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.39,0:57:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,微型晶片市场的八成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the world microchip market.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.60,0:57:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提议不要让…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I propose to end…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.50,0:57:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,硅谷继续这垄断局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}the domination of Silicon Valley…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.97,0:57:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而让我们来控制这市场\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave us in control of that market.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.31,0:57:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you propose?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.48,0:57:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,主攻计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Project Main Strike…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.75,0:57:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们每人要给我一亿元\N{\fnArial\fs30}for which each of you will pay me $ 100 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.45,0:57:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一亿元？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred million dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.52,0:57:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我们净收入的一半？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus half our net income?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.69,0:57:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我签订专利的销售协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under an exclusive marketing agreement with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.63,0:57:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是荒谬的条款！\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are outrageous terms!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.53,0:57:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者示范过后你会认同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, perhaps a demonstration would convince you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.90,0:57:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想参予 谢谢你 - 随便你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want no part of it, thank you. - As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.27,0:57:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们余下的讨论内容很秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of our discussion must, of course, be confidential.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.57,0:57:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请你到外面等好吗？- 你想的话 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you wait outside? - If you'd like me to, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.48,0:58:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 麻烦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.41,0:58:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,美黛\N{\fnArial\fs30}May Day…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.68,0:58:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,会招呼你喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}will provide you with a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.35,0:58:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.55,0:58:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁想退出吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, does anybody else want to drop out?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.50,0:58:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.27,0:58:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a view.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.73,0:58:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,最适合杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To a kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.07,0:59:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个柠檬？五块钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lemon? Okay. Five dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.94,0:59:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你吗？你要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help the next person? Can I help you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.97,0:59:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许我可以帮你 - 想找些特别的东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I help the next person? - Looking for something special?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.08,0:59:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 软壳蟹 - 里面应该有一些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. Soft-shell crabs. - I might have some in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.48,0:59:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.33,0:59:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,中情局的李查克 很高兴跟007合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck Lee, CIA. It's a pleasure working with 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.10,1:00:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 佐伦怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Now what about Zorin?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.97,1:00:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在城里 如果你想 我可派人跟踪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in town. I can have him tailed if you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.40,1:00:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.70,1:00:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尼是个地质学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conley is a geologist.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.41,1:00:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在东湾负责佐伦石油开垦的工程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Runs Zorin's oil reclamation project in the East Bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.64,1:00:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此之前是开垦南非金矿的总工程师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last job, chief engineer on a South African gold mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.91,1:00:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,矿洞塌下引致二十矿工死亡 他匆忙离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left in a hurry after a cave-in killed 20 miners.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.92,1:00:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎是佐伦的人 那女人和那支票呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like Zorin's kind of man. What about the girl and the check?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.42,1:00:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国有许多叫塞顿的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how many S. Suttons there are in the US?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.42,1:00:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正留意佐伦的帐户 不过那支票还没兑现\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're watching Zorin's account, but the check hasn't been cashed yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.96,1:00:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫勒呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mortner?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.69,1:00:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可被他骗倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a real winner here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.13,1:00:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他其实叫汉斯格罗伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is actually Hans Glaub…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.86,1:00:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是研发类固醇的德国先锋\N{\fnArial\fs30}a German pioneer in the development of steroids.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.93,1:00:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,即是跟马匹注射有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ties in with the horse injections.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.50,1:00:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,二次大战时 他为集中营的孕妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}During World War II, he experimented with steroids on pregnant women…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.41,1:00:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,注射类固醇作实验以提高胎儿的智力\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the concentration camps in an attempt to enhance intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.44,1:00:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有成功吗？- 几乎所有孕妇都流产\N{\fnArial\fs30}- With any success? - Virtually every mother aborted…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.61,1:00:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有少数婴儿有高度的智商\N{\fnArial\fs30}although a handful of children were produced with phenomenal IQs.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.92,1:00:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有副作用 他们都是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was a side effect. They were psychotics.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.95,1:00:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何格罗伯没被战争罪行委员会审讯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wasn't this Mortner… or Glaub… tried by the War Crimes Commission?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.19,1:01:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄国人把他抓去 把他困在实验室内\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Russians grabbed him. Set him up in a laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.49,1:01:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他花了数年研究类固醇帮助俄国运动员\N{\fnArial\fs30}He spent several years developing steroids for their athletes…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.13,1:01:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在十五年前不见了踪影\N{\fnArial\fs30}then dropped out of sight about 15 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.97,1:01:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多是佐伦逃到西方的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the same time Zorin came over to the West.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.17,1:01:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伦会是其中一个类固醇孩子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could Zorin be one of the steroid kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.04,1:01:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,年龄绝对吻合 而且他也是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's definitely the right age, and he's certainly psychotic.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.98,1:01:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么他的石油企业呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about his oil operations?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.01,1:01:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奥鲁克先生 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. O'Rourke. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.75,1:01:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打扰你一下好吗？- 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you spare a minute? - Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.49,1:01:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那石油厂看来很正派 但却为捕蟹渔民带来麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole operation looks clean except for a problem with the crab fishermen.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.56,1:01:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥鲁克是他们的代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'Rourke represents them.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.46,1:01:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 奥鲁克先生 他是我向你提及过的记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Mr. O'Rourke. Here's that reporter I told you about.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.03,1:01:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥鲁克先生 听说你遇到麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. O'Rourke, I understand you have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.86,1:01:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伦的抽油站破坏了其中一个最好的捕蟹地\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Zorin oil-pumping station ruined one of the best crab patches in the bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.20,1:01:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蟹被吓走了？- 不 蟹没有走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Scared them away? - No, they didn't go nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.84,1:01:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们只是消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.24,1:01:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去看看那抽油站\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to take a look at that oil-pumping station.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.94,1:01:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难的 那里守卫森严\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll be tough. It's very heavily guarded.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.90,1:02:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍后要测试新设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be testing new equipment shortly.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.01,1:02:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,提高警觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep a sharp lookout.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.71,1:02:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别让任何人走近这码头 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't want anyone near this dock. - Very good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.54,1:02:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第5至15号井已打开 - 油井的情况怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wells 5 to 15 are open, sir. - What's the report from the wells?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.91,1:02:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,闸阀已打开准备进水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wells report valves open and ready to receive water.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.89,1:02:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极 打开16至25号闸阀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Open valves 16 to 25.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.72,1:02:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,十号闸阀只能有一半容量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valve 10 operating at half capacity, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.62,1:02:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把主攻计划的闸阀程序的最新情况告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me an update on valve procedure on the Main Strike program.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.29,1:02:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早会有队员作实地检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have a field crew check it out in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.86,1:03:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开26至30号闸阀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valves to wells 26 to 30 open, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.86,1:03:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,加快进水程序百分之五十力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Activate pumping procedure, 50% power.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.93,1:03:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,加强力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Increase it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.70,1:03:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,到最大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maximum.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.14,1:03:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,防线的新密封装置还没完全测试好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new seals in the line are not fully tested.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.30,1:03:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天后就是主攻计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Main Strike's in three days.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.87,1:03:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何延误…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any delays…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.14,1:03:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都要负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hold you responsible.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.28,1:03:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.71,1:03:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,全力开动 慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it up to full, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.07,1:04:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关闭 - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut down! - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.80,1:04:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 螺旋桨给轧住 - 快去修理！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Propeller's jammed! - Fix it!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.06,1:04:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,派人潜进水底\N{\fnArial\fs30}You there, get a man down there!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.13,1:05:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快去 - 快来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. Move it. - Come on, you guys. Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.00,1:05:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关掉警报系统 - 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get the alarms turned off. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.10,1:05:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,按那按钮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit that switch there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.37,1:05:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快些！清理那个帮浦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up, goddamn it! Clear that pump.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.41,1:05:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝不可延误\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the last thing we wanted. We're behind schedule.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.21,1:05:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.46,1:05:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,警卫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guard!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.94,1:05:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫科尼恢复进水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Conley to resume pumping.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.94,1:05:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is yours, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.18,1:05:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拆去雷管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defuse it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.11,1:07:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝娜伊凡诺瓦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pola lvanova.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.05,1:07:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德！到那海滩看看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the beach area. Make it fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.52,1:07:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.01,1:07:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}That feels wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.85,1:08:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这个位置更舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels even better from where I'm sitting.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.69,1:08:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要热一点吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like it hotter?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.99,1:08:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.59,1:08:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you have.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.63,1:08:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,变得更可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're even lovelier.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.60,1:08:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我与博索尔在伦敦那一晚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That night in London when I was with the Bolshoi…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.60,1:08:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,演技出众\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, what a performance.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.97,1:08:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们后来在更衣室时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my dressing room later…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.14,1:08:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是被委派引诱你的特务吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you know I was an agent with orders to seduce you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.85,1:08:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我为何送你三打红玫瑰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I sent you three dozen red roses?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.89,1:08:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你演技才出众\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that was a performance.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.00,1:08:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,真巧合 我们竟然在这种情形下碰上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite a coincidence… us running into one another like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.24,1:09:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把真相告诉我 - 别谈公事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Tell me the truth. - Let's not talk shop.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.61,1:09:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如播放一些…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's put on something more…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.01,1:09:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,激励人心的音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}inspirational.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.25,1:09:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.10,1:09:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.67,1:09:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些泡泡使我发痒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bubbles tickle my…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.17,1:09:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,柴可夫斯基！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tchaikovsky!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.78,1:09:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以缓和两国关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detente can be beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.08,1:09:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是讨论政治的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no time to be discussing politics.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.68,1:10:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, darling?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.05,1:10:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know something.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.72,1:10:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我就送你六打红玫瑰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow I shall buy you six dozen red roses.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.79,1:10:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我很心急\N{\fnArial\fs30}How lovely, darling. I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.41,1:10:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,录音带呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tape.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.03,1:10:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,硅谷行动绝不能延误\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Silicon Valley operation must not be delayed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.97,1:11:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天后就是主攻计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Main Strike's in three days.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.30,1:11:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何延误…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any delays…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.20,1:11:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都需要负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hold you responsible.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.21,1:11:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须确保…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's essential…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.04,1:11:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余管道准时打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}the remaining pipelines are open on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.38,1:11:22.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（豪尔办公室）
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.22,1:11:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的经济需要像佐伦先生那样的投资者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our economy needs investors like Mr. Zorin.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.39,1:11:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,加州非常欢迎他\N{\fnArial\fs30}California welcomes him with open arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.89,1:11:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以引用你这句话吗？- 当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I quote you on that, Mr. Howe? - Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.40,1:11:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么要我告诉伦敦经济时报吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else I can tell the London Financial Times?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.70,1:11:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的读者或想知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. My readers may like to know…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.47,1:11:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何佐伦把海水抽进到他的管子里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}why Zorin is pumping seawater into his pipeline…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.77,1:11:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是把石油抽出？\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of pumping oil out?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.78,1:11:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,海水是用以测试管道会否破损…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seawater is used to test the integrity of the pipeline…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.45,1:11:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,若管子出现裂缝 它比石油安全得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a lot safer than oil… just in case there are any leaks.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.35,1:11:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我可不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}L… I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.16,1:12:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 豪尔先生 - 别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, Mr. Howe. - Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.46,1:12:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 访问到此为止 - 请从这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That about wraps it up. - Would you come this way, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.20,1:12:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,若再需要任何资料 请找我 阁下是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd like any further information, just call me, Mister…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.54,1:12:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯史托 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stock. James Stock. Thank you, Mr. Howe.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.34,1:12:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 豪尔先生 - 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Howe. - Stacey, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.31,1:12:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些气孔测试想让你看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have some porosity tests I want to show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.75,1:12:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要迟到了 只能给你两分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm running late. I can only spare a couple of minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.12,1:12:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.90,1:12:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者他知道你怎样想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's after your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.33,1:12:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.95,1:12:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚气温稍低 华氏57度\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for a low tonight of 57.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.25,1:12:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天会升至华氏75度\N{\fnArial\fs30}High tomorrow, 75.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.05,1:13:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也可畅顺呼吸 空气污染指示说没有烟雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your lungs are in for a break. Air pollution control says no smog.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.05,1:13:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来有新闻简报\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming up on half past the hour and our news summary.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.53,1:13:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来后送上更舒服的音乐 为通勤者解忧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll be back with some more smooth sounds to soothe those commuter blues.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.89,1:13:12.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣安德烈斯湖水库）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.25,1:15:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢走出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out real slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.52,1:15:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是佐伦另一个走狗 你是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just another Zorin stooge, Mister…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.23,1:15:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管你叫做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever your name was.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.56,1:15:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫詹姆斯史托 是伦敦经济时报的记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it's James Stock, London Financial Times.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.70,1:15:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以告诉警方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can… You can tell the police which.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.27,1:15:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可告诉他们关于 佐伦给你五百万元报酬的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you can tell them about the $5 million payoff you received from Zorin.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.17,1:15:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过那支票\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the check.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.95,1:15:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你切断了电话线\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cut the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.41,1:15:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.19,1:15:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.58,1:16:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面装了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this loaded with?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.44,1:16:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 石盐 - 你现在才告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rock salt. - Now you tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.34,1:16:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那瓶子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vase!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.21,1:16:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.78,1:16:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.32,1:16:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Granddad.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.39,1:17:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.58,1:17:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.78,1:17:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.51,1:17:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕所有皇帝的骑兵和手下都无法修补它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid all the king's horses and all the king's men won't do much for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.05,1:17:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 那是爷爷的骨灰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. It was Granddad's ashes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.79,1:17:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他很喜欢激战的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he always loved a good fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.16,1:17:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是史塔西塞顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Stacey Sutton.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.09,1:17:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是记者？你叫做…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're a reporter? What was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.13,1:17:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯史托 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stock. James Stock. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.36,1:17:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在为佐伦的报导搜集资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm researching an article on Zorin.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.73,1:17:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才借用朋友的名字 才得以获邀进城堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I used a friend's name to get an invitation to the chateau.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.74,1:17:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以告诉你佐伦的事 - 我很想听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can tell you things about Zorin. - I'd like to hear them.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.41,1:17:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要喂它 你饿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to feed him. Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.71,1:17:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吃什么？猫饲料吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you serving, Whiskas?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.45,1:17:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰箱只有少许吃剩的东西 我的厨艺很差劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only have a few leftovers in the fridge. I'm a pathetic cook.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.78,1:18:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我帮你一把 - 你会煮饭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll lend a hand. - You can cook?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.42,1:18:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会一点皮毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been known to dabble.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.29,1:18:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成了 蛋奶火腿蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voila. Quiche des Cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.73,1:18:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎很不错 什么来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds interesting. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.63,1:18:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,煎蛋卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}An omelette.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.14,1:18:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续说你爷爷的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you were telling me about your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.71,1:18:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把塞顿石油留给爸爸 爸就期望在我这个独女…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left Sutton Oil to Dad, who expected me as the only child…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.58,1:18:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,将来可继承他 所以我大学时念地质学\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take it over someday, so at college I studied geology.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.68,1:18:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后呢？- 佐伦出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And then what happened? - Zorin.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.55,1:18:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在一次虚构的代理权争战中接管了塞顿石油\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took over Sutton Oil in a rigged proxy fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.69,1:18:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他上法庭争辩 我失去了一切…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fought him in the courts. It's taken everything I had…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.59,1:18:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,花尽所有现金 甚至连家具都卖掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the cash, the furniture, everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.46,1:18:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我当了州政府地质学家…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I took this job as state geologist…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.69,1:18:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只保住这房子和我的股份\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've just managed to hold onto this house and then my shares.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.80,1:18:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那五百万就是你的股份？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the $5 million were for, your shares?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.90,1:18:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我股份的十倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten times more than they're worth.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.14,1:19:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只想我闭嘴 停止诉讼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just drop the lawsuit and shut my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.44,1:19:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't accepted yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.68,1:19:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以佐伦就派他的手下来帮你做决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Zorin sent along his gorillas to help you make up your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.85,1:19:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经帮我做了决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.49,1:19:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁愿卖掉所有东西 住在帐篷也不会放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd sell everything and live in a tent before I'd give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.79,1:19:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,味道真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.52,1:19:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对那些家伙的身手…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the way you handled those men…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.13,1:19:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, those…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.96,1:19:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,粗野的人可会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}baboons could come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.53,1:19:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.54,1:20:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去检查窗户…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check the windows…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.04,1:20:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有门户和再接回电话线\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the doors and… oh, reconnect the telephone.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.81,1:20:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那接合箱子在我卧房窗户外\N{\fnArial\fs30}The connecting box is outside my bedroom window.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.98,1:20:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我应该会找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I should be able to find that.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.15,1:21:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 - 早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning. - Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.36,1:21:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I say.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.29,1:21:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有早餐送到 你的宠物怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breakfast out of bed. What's wrong with your pets?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.46,1:21:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾有轻微地震 它们对此很敏感的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had an earth tremor. They're extremely sensitive to seismic activity.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.96,1:21:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看地震中心的报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what the earthquake center has on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.67,1:21:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是轻微震动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a minor tremor.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.17,1:21:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,里氏震级2.5级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Measured 2.5 on the Richter scale.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.17,1:21:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,位置是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Location…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.98,1:21:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很奇怪 震央在佐伦的油田附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's odd. The epicenter's near Zorin's oil field.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.28,1:21:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨天告诉豪尔 佐伦把海水抽进他的井\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told Howe yesterday that Zorin was pumping seawater into his wells.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.12,1:21:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两者有连系吗？- 海水？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there a connection? - Seawater?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.15,1:21:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些井在海沃德断层里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those wells are in the Hayward Fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.96,1:22:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你肯是？- 我亲自查探的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure? - I checked it myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.26,1:22:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可非常危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's incredibly dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.03,1:22:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,豪尔得马上制止佐伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howe has to stop Zorin now.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.30,1:22:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没道理！我没其他选择！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is totally unreasonable. Now, look, you leave me no alternative.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.65,1:22:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事？- 他解雇我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - I got fired.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.98,1:22:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他解…解雇我 - 冷静一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He fired… He fired me. - Now, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.15,1:22:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚跟我一位来自华盛顿的朋友见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}This evening we are going to meet a friend of mine from Washington.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.42,1:22:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者…只是或者 他可以帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe… just maybe… he'll come up with a few answers.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.17,1:22:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道佐伦的企图后 再进行下一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish we were more specific about Zorin's intentions before I go to the top.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.61,1:22:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,淹没断层会造成大地震的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flooding a fault could cause a major earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.64,1:22:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但佐伦会有什么好处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what would Zorin have to gain?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.18,1:22:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伦曾在录音带上提及硅谷 那会受影响吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the tape Zorin mentions Silicon Valley. Could that be affected?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.75,1:23:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,影响不会太大 硅谷太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not severely. Silicon Valley's too far away.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.09,1:23:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,若知道那包含了多少个井 我们就能更清楚现况\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we knew how many wells were involved, we might get a clearer picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.69,1:23:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,资料可在市政厅找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}That information's available at city hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.56,1:23:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍有通行证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still have my security pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.80,1:23:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那出发吧 - 让我上楼去拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then let's go to city hall. - Let me go upstairs and get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.47,1:23:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去请华盛顿加派协助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll contact Washington. Tell them we need more help out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.20,1:23:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别浪费时间 我们只有24小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't waste time. According to the tape, there's only 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.19,1:24:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 杰克 - 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good evening, Jack. - Evening, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.40,1:24:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会太久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't be long.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.95,1:24:50.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（档案室）
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.72,1:25:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,「主攻计划」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Main Strike."
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.89,1:25:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that place.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.33,1:25:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣安德烈斯断层旁有一个被弃置的银矿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an abandoned silver mine by the San Andreas Fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.54,1:25:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍然安然活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alive and well, I see…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.54,1:25:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,依旧在黑暗中把任务弄砸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and still bungling in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.84,1:25:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为何不给我点曙光？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then why don't you enlighten me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.38,1:25:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕你不会明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of your depth.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.61,1:25:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你 塞顿小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, Miss Sutton…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.22,1:25:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该接受我那比慷慨还好的条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}you should have accepted my more than generous offer.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.82,1:25:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以收回你的… - 别理他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can take your offer… - Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.19,1:25:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是变态的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.86,1:25:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩联合起来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two have joined forces?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.83,1:26:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就易办了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That simplifies things.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.60,1:26:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's probably armed.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.41,1:26:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.38,1:26:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佐伦先生 - 报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Zorin. - Call the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.19,1:26:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.42,1:26:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知警方有人非法闯进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them there's been a break-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.39,1:26:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他们尽快赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask them to get here as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.66,1:26:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被利用了 豪尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being used, Mr. Howe.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.93,1:26:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.87,1:26:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.27,1:26:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 这里有人非法闯进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. We've had a break-in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.57,1:26:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请说出位置在哪儿？- 市政厅 306号办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your location, sir? - City hall, office 306.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.27,1:26:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请马上来 - 我们立刻来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come at once. - Right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.24,1:26:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们做了什么？- 你解雇她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What have they done? - You discharged her, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.25,1:26:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她与她的同伙一起来杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she and her accomplice came here to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.58,1:26:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就放火以掩饰罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they set fire to the office to conceal the crime…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.36,1:27:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他们却被困在升降机内\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they were trapped in the elevator…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.53,1:27:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,葬身火海\N{\fnArial\fs30}and perished in the flames.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.43,1:27:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那即是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that means…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.40,1:27:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have to be…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.10,1:27:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.61,1:27:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样不好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's rather neat, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.78,1:27:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,了不起 我佩服得无话可说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant. I'm almost speechless with admiration.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.15,1:27:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭直觉而即兴做的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intuitive improvisation…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.72,1:27:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是天才的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's the secret of genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.62,1:27:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫勒博士会对他的产品感到自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Herr Doktor Mortner would be proud of his creation.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.17,1:27:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.51,1:27:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.45,1:28:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走！- 快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Out. Out! - Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.49,1:28:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.60,1:29:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.44,1:29:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Stacey.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.88,1:29:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手给我 伸过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hand. Stretch!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.42,1:29:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,伸过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stretch!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.89,1:29:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.33,1:29:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 别丢下我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.38,1:30:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.28,1:30:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.53,1:30:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.37,1:30:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.64,1:30:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是市政厅！- 我通知消防局\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is the city hall! - I'll call the fire department!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.82,1:30:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝试从梁的另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and come this side of the girder.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.62,1:30:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓住它 - 我抓不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Catch this. - I can't reach it!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.02,1:30:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 抓住它！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.46,1:30:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,努力！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, swing!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.52,1:31:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.52,1:31:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖 快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl. You're nearly there.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.96,1:31:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.53,1:31:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,手伸出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stretch.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.27,1:31:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫这电视采访队走开 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this TV crew out of here, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.44,1:31:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挡我的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.54,1:31:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move back!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.41,1:32:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人被困在市政厅内\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we know right now is that there are people trapped inside of city hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.28,1:32:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,大火从顶层冒出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flames coming out of the roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.76,1:32:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你们让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up, will you? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.23,1:32:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 让我们通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move back now. Let us through, goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.34,1:33:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.08,1:33:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.12,1:33:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她透一口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give her some air.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.69,1:33:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别挡路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming through. Out of the way, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.69,1:33:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,史塔西 安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stacey, you're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.53,1:33:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me through.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.50,1:33:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挡路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me through, goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.93,1:33:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想跟你谈谈 - 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, buddy, I wanna talk to you. - Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.44,1:33:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你到豪尔先生的办公室 便会发现他已死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can get through to Howe's office, you'll find him dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.04,1:33:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到他 还找到这支枪 是你的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found him. And we found this gun. This yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.24,1:33:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 谢谢 - 转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, thanks. - Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.84,1:33:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可问问中情局的查克 他知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, if you check with Chuck Lee of the CIA, he'll tell you who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.71,1:33:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在唐人街发现他的尸体 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We found his body in Chinatown. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.68,1:33:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你已经被拘捕 - 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're under arrest. - Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.69,1:33:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是伦敦经济时报的詹姆斯史托\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is James Stock of the London Financial Times.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.26,1:33:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我是英国特工处的情报员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, Captain, I'm with the British Secret Service.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.09,1:33:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫邦德 詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name is Bond. James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.29,1:33:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he? - Are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.90,1:34:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 - 那我是狄克崔西 你已被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - I'm Dick Tracy and you're under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.57,1:34:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.08,1:34:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去哪儿？梯子没有锁住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's that guy goin'? That ladder's unlocked.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.31,1:34:21.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（危险 梯子未上锁时不要驾驶）
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.99,1:34:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是英国特务？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that true what you said back there, about the British Secret Service?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.99,1:34:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.96,1:34:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的真名是詹姆斯邦德 你得相信我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}My real name is Bond. James Bond. You must take my word for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.19,1:35:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,双手放这 放在方向盘上！方向盘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, put your hand on this. The wheel, the wheel!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.39,1:35:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,接过去 把脚踏在这位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take over. Put your foot on here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.70,1:35:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.40,1:35:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位 拦截被偷的消防车上的疑犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}To all units, intercept murder suspect in stolen fire truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.34,1:35:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他或许带有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may be armed…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.64,1:35:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是危险人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's sure dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.98,1:35:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的挡泥板互相卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our fenders are locked.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.83,1:35:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说了 它们给卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, we're locked.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.83,1:35:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.29,1:36:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拐弯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.06,1:36:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这边 是那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this way, that way!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.83,1:36:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.04,1:36:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,摇我回去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swing me back!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.96,1:36:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续行驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive on.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.11,1:37:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想我可以追到他 - 去追！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think I can get him. - Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.03,1:37:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.93,1:37:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就无法跟上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should keep them on the wrong track.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.94,1:37:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,找谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.18,1:37:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,升起大桥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise the bridge?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.91,1:37:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.48,1:37:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.52,1:37:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要逮到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him. Oh, geez, I got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.40,1:37:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走！继续走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going! Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.42,1:38:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.40,1:38:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.84,1:38:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.47,1:38:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}God! Oh, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.11,1:38:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.15,1:38:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.09,1:38:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈里斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harris.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.16,1:39:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你休想升做警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can forget about that sergeant promotion.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.60,1:39:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要赔偿那辆车 在每月的薪水里扣除一百块\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll pay for that vehicle. One hundred bucks a month out of your paycheck.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.22,1:39:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒来 我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up. We're there.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.46,1:39:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个被弃置的矿场仍有许多活动进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of activity for an abandoned mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.13,1:39:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那卡车的炸药足够他们数个月使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}That truckload of explosives should last them for months.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.60,1:39:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是下一年的供应量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes next year's supply.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.47,1:39:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.41,1:39:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪儿发生火灾了？- 你的车子后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the fire? - On your rear end.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.02,1:40:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.21,1:40:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是规例\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.38,1:40:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 必须戴上安全帽 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hard hat area. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.98,1:40:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the signs.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.12,1:40:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！你迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it! You're late.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.49,1:40:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two, come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.50,1:40:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮一帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.66,1:40:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, leave it there.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.27,1:40:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去小屋喝杯咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a coffee over in the hut.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.67,1:40:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十分钟后回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.37,1:40:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是妇女解放运动 她们接收了工会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's women's lib. They're taking over the Teamsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.34,1:40:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续搬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this stuff movin'!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.28,1:40:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已迟了一小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're an hour late.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.46,1:41:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该仔细看看那矿洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should take a closer look at that mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.17,1:41:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么在阻止你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's stopping you?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.60,1:41:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的主意真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good idea of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.74,1:41:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜你没有一件合适的制服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pity you couldn't find one that fits.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.68,1:41:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有车坐为什么要用走的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why walk when you can ride?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.38,1:41:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续前进…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it coming. Keep it coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.09,1:41:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你别动好吗？- 你知道我坐着什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will you keep still. - Do you know what I'm sitting on?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.23,1:41:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽量不去想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying not to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.28,1:43:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面准备 带他们来 清除这些障碍物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by forward. Bring the gang up here and clear these barriers away.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.22,1:43:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 我们时间不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go. We haven't got all day.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.49,1:43:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,清除安全路障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove the safety barrier.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.76,1:43:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.20,1:43:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,开起重机的 把那起重机吊架摆动到这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the crane. Swing the cradle over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.47,1:43:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it off. Take it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.23,1:44:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,提起它 轻轻提起它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it up. Bring it up, easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.67,1:44:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.24,1:44:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到什么吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You found anything? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.91,1:44:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I have.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.88,1:44:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好…低一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Good. Lower.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.36,1:44:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那些楔子紧紧地塞进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get those wedges in there tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.77,1:44:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞进里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em in.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.63,1:44:48.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（炸药）
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.59,1:44:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣安德烈斯湖就在我们上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}San Andreas Lake's right above us.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.62,1:45:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,严重渗水 随时会淹水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots of seepage. Could flood any minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.79,1:45:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续完成支撑顶部的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finishing shoring up the roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.49,1:45:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让拖车回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll send the lug back.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.76,1:45:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽快送些木材来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring up some timbers on the double!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.61,1:45:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会杀死数百万人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll kill millions.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.68,1:45:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些绿灯就是佐伦的油井\N{\fnArial\fs30}These green lights… they're Zorin's oil wells…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.51,1:45:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是用它们把海水打进海沃德断层内\N{\fnArial\fs30}the ones he's been using to pump seawater into the Hayward Fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.45,1:45:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些湖下面的隧道有什么作用？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are these tunnels for under these lakes?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.29,1:45:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们直接通往圣安德烈斯断层的这部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}These lead straight into this section of the San Andreas fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.79,1:45:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伦只需要炸开这些湖的底部\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Zorin just has to blast through the bottom of these lakes…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.90,1:45:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能淹没断层\N{\fnArial\fs30}to flood the fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.40,1:45:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 并带来严重地震？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And create a double earthquake? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.40,1:45:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了…在我们脚下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except… except right beneath us…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.54,1:45:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是地质学上的锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the key geological lock…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.84,1:45:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,能立刻阻止断层移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}that keeps the faults from moving at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.35,1:45:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.63,1:46:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有那些炸药…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those explosives…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.40,1:46:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,能足够炸开那个锁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}would they be enough to break the lock?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.87,1:46:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.67,1:46:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,若引爆炸药…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they go off…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.70,1:46:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个断层都会立刻移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}both faults move at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.77,1:46:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,硅谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silicon Valley…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.34,1:46:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,和硅谷的一切就会永远沉下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everything in it… submerged forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.91,1:46:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,若在满潮爆炸 影响力将会更大\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it happened at the peak of the spring tide for maximum effect…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.69,1:46:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,满潮在今早9时41分出现 还不到一小时！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's today at 9:41. In less than an hour!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.59,1:46:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要去提醒大家 - 等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to go and warn people. - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.67,1:46:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.34,1:46:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.95,1:47:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.29,1:47:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他们回去工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em back to work!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.89,1:47:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.40,1:47:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 回去工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. It's all over. Get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.87,1:47:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.87,1:47:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭入口处 别让任何人出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close up the entrance. Nobody gets out.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.14,1:47:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.07,1:47:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.68,1:47:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.09,1:47:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有见过任何人经过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you pass anyone back there?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.39,1:47:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 没看到任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I saw no one.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.73,1:47:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在应往哪边？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now which way?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.20,1:47:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}The map.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.31,1:48:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边是有通道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a draft from up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.47,1:48:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一定是通风井 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It must be a ventilation shaft. - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.99,1:48:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是通往断层的 是湖水\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must lead straight to the fault. The water from the lakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.39,1:48:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 随时都会被淹没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it'll be flooding any moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.86,1:48:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.11,1:48:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩去那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two, that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.90,1:49:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 把手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.39,1:49:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候淹没断层\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to flood the fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.26,1:49:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是美黛和我的手下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But May Day and my men…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.97,1:49:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 非常巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a convenient coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.44,1:49:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们对你很忠心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Zorin, those men are loyal to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.11,1:49:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.55,1:49:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快找人来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody get help, quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.36,1:50:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Run for your life!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.14,1:50:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一些备用弹夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me some spare clips.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.78,1:51:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续爬！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep climbing!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.50,1:51:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续爬！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.65,1:52:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.12,1:52:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没延误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.20,1:52:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.90,1:53:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为那臭家伙爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought that creep loved me!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.24,1:53:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只你被他出卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the only one he double-crossed.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.02,1:53:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有舷外阀都已锁上\N{\fnArial\fs30}All outboard valves fully locked, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.55,1:54:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,水位正在下降\N{\fnArial\fs30}The water level's dropping.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.79,1:54:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮浦压力没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pump pressure, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.44,1:54:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 你现在无法再为他们做什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. There's nothing you can do for them now.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.28,1:54:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,升空离开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up and away!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.46,1:55:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,硅谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silicon Valley.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.73,1:55:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,太完美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.63,1:55:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这位置停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold position here.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.20,1:55:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要几分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only minutes more, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.34,1:55:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何事也阻止不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can stop it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.87,1:55:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,史上最澎湃的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The greatest cataclysm…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.64,1:55:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,洪水\N{\fnArial\fs30}in history.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.71,1:55:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都因为自然灾祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all attributed to natural causes.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.55,1:55:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.19,1:56:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.92,1:56:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要下去拆去那炸药雷管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get down and defuse that detonator.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.42,1:56:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那计时器设置有陷阱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't. The timer's been booby-trapped.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.23,1:56:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你拨弄它 我们会被炸死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you tamper with it, we're gonna blow up.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.80,1:56:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们须把它整个拿上来 但应怎做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we have to bring the whole thing up. But how?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.17,1:56:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,走上钻井架 我吊你下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on the rig. I'll lower you down.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.97,1:56:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,上去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.36,1:56:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.00,1:56:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.50,1:56:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,停在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it there.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.85,1:57:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它吊起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.61,1:57:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.82,1:57:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,太重了 开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too heavy. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.62,1:57:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,上去 混球！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.29,1:57:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 开始！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.41,1:57:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.67,1:58:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.34,1:58:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,摆到卡车那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swing it over to the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.04,1:58:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.54,1:58:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gently.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.72,1:58:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, lower it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.85,1:58:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,提起它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her up.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.52,1:58:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到一分钟它就要爆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've only seconds before this blows…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.56,1:58:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,若真的爆炸的话 那火药桶也会给炸毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if it does, that powder keg goes with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.99,1:58:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.84,1:58:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,手煞车松了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hand brake slipped.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.75,1:58:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,推！推！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push! Push!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.62,1:58:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.12,1:58:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要控制那手煞车 - 跳下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to hold the brake off. - Jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.82,1:58:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我消灭佐伦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Zorin for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.66,1:59:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,美黛 跳下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}May Day, jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.50,1:59:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下几秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only seconds to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.56,1:59:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,美黛 跳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}May Day, jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.66,1:59:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,美黛\N{\fnArial\fs30}May Day.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.25,2:00:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,史塔西 伏下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stacey, behind you! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.55,2:00:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull her.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.69,2:00:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉她进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull her in.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.07,2:00:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉她到后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Get in the back.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.91,2:00:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,船头很重 他一是在停泊绳索上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ship's nose is heavy. He must be on the mooring rope.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.71,2:01:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个对他的伤害大于对我的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will hurt him more than me.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.03,2:02:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,加大马力！\N{\fnArial\fs30}More… More power!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.80,2:02:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续！\N{\fnArial\fs30}More. Do it!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.59,2:02:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,全速前进！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full throttle!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.50,2:02:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,向右转 快些！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right rudder. Do it!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.28,2:03:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停手！- 抓住她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop it! - Get her off!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.35,2:03:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓住她！- 停手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get her off! - Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.62,2:03:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疯了吗？- 走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you crazy? - Get away!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.39,2:03:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,停手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.14,2:03:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,去捉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get him.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.81,2:03:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.59,2:03:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.76,2:04:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,找地方站稳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a foothold!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.21,2:05:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,史塔西 把手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stacey, give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.99,2:05:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.92,2:05:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲到管子下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get under the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.69,2:05:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, stay there.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.57,2:05:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:04.29,2:06:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.89,2:06:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,史塔西 抓紧了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stacey, hold tight!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.62,2:06:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔走它！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it out!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.00,2:06:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史塔西 你在吗？- 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stacey, are you there? - You betcha.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:26.07,2:06:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.25,2:06:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.25,2:06:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.89,2:06:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你需要计程车时 总是找不到一辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's never a cab when you want one.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.70,2:06:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,给邦德同志的列宁勋章\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Order of Lenin for Comrade Bond.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:50.47,2:06:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,历来首次颁授给苏联以外的市民\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first time ever awarded to a non-Soviet citizen.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.00,2:06:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为若硅谷被破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have expected the KGB to celebrate…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.14,2:07:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,国安会是会庆祝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Silicon Valley had been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.21,2:07:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,相反 上将…\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the contrary, Admiral…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.51,2:07:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有它 俄国会在哪儿做研究？\N{\fnArial\fs30}where would Russian research be without it?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.39,2:07:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德在吗？我想亲自感谢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Commander Bond here? I'd like to thank him personally.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.12,2:07:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可惜 他不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly, he's missing.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.56,2:07:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会继续寻找…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are continuing our search…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.99,2:07:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但作了最坏的打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}but must presume the worst.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.14,2:08:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这里涂多点肥皂 讨厌 我把肥皂弄掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a little soap there. Drat! I dropped the soap.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.91,2:08:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去捡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.84,2:08:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是肥皂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not the soap.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.39,2:08:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 爷爷找Q\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Grandfather calling Q.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:22.46,2:08:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the position?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.23,2:08:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,007仍活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}007 alive.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:25.43,2:08:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.80,2:08:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:29.10,2:08:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只不过在清理细微的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just cleaning up a few details.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.32,2:08:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, James.
